    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement by a Humanoid)</em></p><p>A dire wolf’s tooth hangs from this simple cord necklace. While you wear it, you have a +1 bonus to ability checks and saving throws.</p><p><strong>Curse.</strong> This necklace is cursed. Attuning to it curses you, and the curse can’t be removed until Harkon Lukas dies. As long as you remain cursed, on the night of a full moon you become a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmWerewolf000000]{Werewolf} serving Harkon Lukas under the DM’s control.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-g0jNfAvGsulsMySe\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Le bonus de +1 est automatique. La transformation en loup-garou les nuits de pleine lune est à gérer par le MJ.</p></section>",
